<title>NETHERLANDS: Nutricia probes Friesland Dairy link.</title>
<headline>Nutricia probes Friesland Dairy link.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food group Nutricia NV said on Thursday it was investigating the possiblities of combining some activities with Friesland Dairy Foods Holding NV or transferring some activities between the companies.</p>
</text>
